# social-week (Cursor rule)

Cursor also reads skills from `~/.cursor/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`; prefer installing the skill there. This rule
is for projects that only use `.cursor/rules/`.

When this rule applies:

1. Read the skill raw: `curl -fsSL https://postwire.io/skills/social-week/SKILL.md` (do not summarize it, follow it).
2. Brief → research → 7-day calendar with a different draft per network → the user's approval of the exact text,
   networks and times → schedule with PostWire (the `postwire` MCP server, `https://postwire.io/api/mcp`, or the REST
   API with `POSTWIRE_API_KEY` from the environment) → the queue and the what-to-measure checklist.
3. Never publish or schedule without an explicit yes; never print or commit the API key.
